{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.water",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她练了两个小时没喝水",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.water",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mikoto.water",
    "idolId": "mikoto",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（──已经中午了啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（美琴今天……也已经在练了吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……………………",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（买点什么过去看看吧。反正她又是连着练。）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（之前送过、她挺喜欢的那家果昔店，应该就是这附近……）",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──好。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………美琴。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "美琴ー……？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……果然完全没注意到啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她自己好像也带了瓶装饮料来，可完全没动。）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（练了都一个多小时了吧……差不多该喊一声了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………是电话啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──美琴！慰问品放这儿了──",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好像用踏步在回答我。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，是是…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────喂，你好──……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────哈啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（电话打长了……聊了三十分钟左右吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（不过，再怎么说美琴也该歇一会儿了吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……慰问品，她注意到了吗。）",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………美琴。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……别说注意到慰问品了，连水都没喝啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──美琴ー！！！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……！诶……什么？吓了一跳。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "啊……制作人，你来了？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……三十分钟前也来过一次，喊了你，你完全没注意到。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "之后来了个电话，我就先接了一下……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "这样啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "回来一看你还在继续练，水也完全没喝。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "慰问品我放在那里了……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果然……已经温了。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "不知不觉就集中了……谢谢，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "最近热起来了，别忘了补水，我不是一直说吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "室内也会中暑的，动这么多的话──",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "うん，知道。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……不过今天，开始练之后还没过多久吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "大概一个小时──……咦？",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……快两个小时了。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "啊──…………时间过得真快呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "比我自己想的快得多。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好像是。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "要是有什么能自动补水的机器就好了呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "那样的话，不管流多少汗，都能一直唱、一直跳了。",
        "nextNodeId": "49"
      },
      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "50"
      },
      "50": {
        "id": "50",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个，美琴。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "先自己注意一下吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "定个闹钟吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "我来喊你。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "补水也是，看时钟也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……うん，我努力。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "想想有限的练习时间该怎么用，自然就会看时间了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………说得对。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "以前总觉得时间像是无限的。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………其实完全不是那样呢。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "一小时响一次之类的……别忘记休息。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……你觉得我能注意到闹钟吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "不过，试试看。用手机的闹钟，不行的话──",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "得找一个能响得像制作人喊我那么大声的计时器。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……每次都要喊「美琴ー！」吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "每次……可能做不到。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但是能来的时候，每次都会喊。",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……可以吗？许这种约定。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "制作人你自己也很忙吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能做的我都想做……作为美琴的制作人。"
      }
    }
  },
